  "item.combatupdate.gipfaeli_war_banner.desc": "No gun — a marcher carrying this rallies everyone around it",
  "block.combatupdate.gipfaeli_guard_post": "Gipfäli Guard Post",
  "block.combatupdate.gipfaeli_guard_post.desc": "Set it down, click it: station soldiers here and set how they guard",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk": "Meat Obelisk",
  "subtitles.combatupdate.block.meat_obelisk.place": "Meat Obelisk speaks",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.1": "\"Is that ham processed? If it's processed, I",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.2": "don't want it.\"",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.3": "Ma'am, that is an eleven pound whole slab of",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.4": "deli ham. It has no bones, fat, or",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.5": "connective tissue. It is an amalgamation of",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.6": "the meat of several pigs, emulsified,",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.7": "liquefied, strained, and ultimately",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.8": "inexorably joined in an unholy meat obelisk.",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.9": "God had no hand in the creation of this",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.10": "abhorrence. The fact that this ham monolith",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.11": "exists proves that God is either impotent to",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.12": "alter His universe or ignorant to the",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.13": "horrors taking place in His kingdom. This",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.14": "prism of pork is more than deli meat. It is",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.15": "a physical declaration of mankind's contempt",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.16": "for the natural order. It is hubris",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.17": "manifest.",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.18": "We also have a lower sodium variety if you",
  "block.combatupdate.meat_obelisk.desc.19": "would prefer that.",
  "item.combatupdate.gipfaeli_command_flag": "Gipfäli Command Flag",
